# Spiritan

## Tech Stack

pnpm | Next.js 16 | React 19 | Tailwind CSS v4 | TypeScript.

## Code Rules

**Mandatory. Apply to every file touched.**

- **Guard clauses** — early returns over nested `if/else`. See `.cursor/rules/function-style.mdc` or `docs/agent/function-style.md`.
- **Karpathy guidelines** — think first, simplicity, surgical changes. See `.cursor/rules/karpathy-guidelines.mdc`.
- **Edge cases** — risky code (API routes, auth, multi-step flows) → walk 7 categories. See `docs/agent/edge-cases.md`.
- **Design tokens** — one token per colour value; no arbitrary `[#hex]` in components. See `.cursor/rules/design-tokens.mdc` or `docs/agent/design-tokens.md`.
- **No secrets** — do not commit `.env.local` or expose private API keys to the browser.

## Git/GitHub Workflow

See `CONTRIBUTING.md`. Agent workflows:

- `docs/agent/create-pr.md` — structured PR body, `gh pr create` against `main`
- `docs/agent/pr-preview.md` — branch diff vs project conventions; GitHub review comments in **English only**

